      "sourceTextSha256": "cd8ca6879af0c5f227e807f5d807b2ee19dd4f44c0952bbf4d9683abb10deeea",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast. Excursion to the Brazilian side of the falls, along the canyon of the Iguaçu River, within a national park of unique flora and fauna. The 275 waterfalls, each with its own name, merge and crash into the Devil’s Throat gorge in a halo of rainbows; on the way to this most powerful of the falls, you pass many smaller cascades.\n\n**Macuco Safari at Iguazu Falls in Brazil**\n\nOptional Macuco Safari: USD 135 per person.\n\n**Bird Park in Iguazu**\n\nOptional Bird Park visit: USD 60 per person.",
